## Adding user##

1. sudo useradd --no-create-home --shell /bin/false prometheus

#### Download prometheus - https://prometheus.io/download/

2. wget https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/releases/download/v3.5.1/prometheus-3.5.1.linux-amd64.tar.gz

####Unzip 

3. tar -xvf prometheus-*.tar.gz

####Get in the folder

4. cd prometheus-3.5.1.linux-amd64/

## commands to move and give permissions

sudo mv prometheus promtool /usr/local/bin/
sudo mkdir /etc/prometheus
sudo mkdir /var/lib/prometheus
sudo mv prometheus.yml /etc/prometheus/
sudo chown -R prometheus:prometheus /etc/prometheus
sudo chown -R prometheus:prometheus /var/lib/prometheus

### enable and start

sudo vi /etc/systemd/system/prometheus.service
sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl start prometheus
sudo systemctl enable prometheus


